<title>HONG KONG: Shenzhen stock market closed on Thursday, Friday.</title>
<headline>Shenzhen stock market closed on Thursday, Friday.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Shenzhen Stock Exchange will be closed on Thursday and Friday for the official Labour Day holiday, an exchange spokesman said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Trading will resume on Monday, May 5, the spokesman said.</p>
</text>
